      "userRole": "Christ University Student",
      "rating": 5,
      "comment": "Finding Hostel Dazee was a lifesaver when moving to Bengaluru! The optical Wi-Fi never drops during online exams, and the meals actually taste like home food.",
      "createdAt": "2025-02-10T11:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "rev-2",
      "propertyId": "prop-1",
      "userName": "Rohan Deshmukh",
      "userRole": "Software Intern, Koramangala",
      "rating": 5,
      "comment": "The visual bed selector made it super easy to pick the window bed in Room 201. The staff is polite and maintenance requests are solved within an hour.",
      "createdAt": "2025-02-14T16:20:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "rev-3",
