      "userRole": "Symbiosis Law School",
      "rating": 5,
      "comment": "Extremely safe for girls with biometric access and strict visitor protocols. The study terrace is my favorite spot to prepare for exams.",
      "createdAt": "2025-02-20T09:15:00.000Z"
    },
